+/* `HUGE_VAL' constants for m68k (where it is infinity).
+   Used by <stdlib.h> and <math.h> functions for overflow.
+   Copyright (C) 1992, 1995, 1996, 1997 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+   This file is part of the GNU C Library.
